  "pr": {
    "description": "### Overview\\nAdds a \`CopyButton\` component to the design system. Writes text to the clipboard and reflects an \`idle -> copied/error -> idle\` status machine with an auto-resetting timeout. Folder structure, styling conventions, and facade pattern mirror \`SegmentedControl\` / \`StarRating\`.\\n\\n### Changelog\\n- \`CopyButton.types.ts\` — \`CopyStatuses\` (\`as const\` + \`ValueOf\`), \`CopyButtonProps\` (\`text\`, \`timeout\`, \`onCopy\`, \`onError\`, render-prop \`children\`).\\n- \`CopyButton.facade.ts\` — \`useCopyButtonFacade\`: async \`navigator.clipboard.writeText\`, status state, timeout reset with unmount cleanup, \`useStableCallback\`.\\n- \`CopyButton.tsx\` — semantic \`button\`, copy/check icon swap, \`data-status\` attribute, \`aria-live=\\"polite\\"\`, optional label render prop.\\n- \`CopyButton.module.scss\` — scoped CSS custom props, \`to-rem\`, \`button-reset\` mixin, per-status color tokens, theme-color TODOs.\\n- \`CopyButton.stories.tsx\` — Default, CustomTimeout, CustomLabels.\\n- \`CopyButton.test.tsx\` — 5 vitest + RTL tests (idle, copy success, timeout reset, error path, custom label).\\n- Exported from \`src/index.ts\` and folder \`index.ts\`.\\n\\n### Notes\\n- Graceful fallback: throws (-> error state + \`onError\`) when the Clipboard API is unavailable rather than silently failing.\\n- Colors flagged with \`// TODO: theme color\`, matching existing placeholder convention.\\n\\n### Verification\\n- \`npx vitest run src/components/CopyButton\` — 5 passing.\\n- \`npx tsc --noEmit\` — clean for CopyButton (pre-existing Carousel error unrelated).\\n- \`npx biome check\` + \`stylelint\` — clean.\\n\\nCloses #42\\n",
    "number": 7,
    "repo": "Idan91/components",
    "sha": "d1a7ef0bca50c6f293e923835629850f22e8ff50",
    "title": "feat: Copy Button",
    "url": "https://github.com/Idan91/components/pull/7"
  },
