      "description": "Retries a failed webhook delivery with exponential backoff instead of dropping it. \`WEBHOOK_MAX_ATTEMPTS\` (default 5) caps the attempts and \`WEBHOOK_BASE_DELAY_MS\` (default 500) sets the first wait, which doubles after each failure.\\n\\n## Retry flow\\n\\n\`\`\`mermaid\\nflowchart LR\\n  A[POST delivery] -->|2xx| B[Done]\\n  A -->|error or non-2xx| C{Attempts left?}\\n  C -->|yes| D[Wait base delay x 2^n] --> A\\n  C -->|no| E[Give up]\\n\`\`\`\\n\\n## Timing\\n\\n\`\`\`mermaid\\nsequenceDiagram\\n  participant W as Worker\\n  participant E as Endpoint\\n  W->>E: attempt 1\\n  E-->>W: 503\\n  Note over W: wait 500 ms\\n  W->>E: attempt 2\\n  E-->>W: 200\\n\`\`\`",
